    "description": {
      "value": "This +1 resilient fire-resistant niyaháat is often created to mark the passage of an Erutaki warrior into adulthood, formed from the chitinous plates of a remorhaz, with larger pieces protecting the chest, shoulders, and head. As you fight, the armor glows red hot.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nThe armor is sheathed in a fire shield.\n\n- **Activate:** Reaction\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n- **Trigger:** You're dealt 30 or more fire damage, before any reduction from your fire resistance\n- **Requirements:** You've used the fire shield activation already today\n\nThe fire shield activation recharges.\n\n**Craft Requirements:** The initial raw materials must include the carapace of a remorhaz (Bestiary 280)."
    },
